{"id":196,"date":"2026-08-22T11:44:00","date_gmt":"2026-08-22T09:44:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/jdworld-os.netbird.cloud\/?p=196"},"modified":"2026-10-27T03:42:25","modified_gmt":"2026-10-27T02:42:25","slug":"jdwos-stream-player-metal-core","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/jdworld.netbird.cloud\/jdwos\/jdwos-packages\/mr_jack\/196\/","title":{"rendered":"[TUI] JDWOS-STREAM-PLAYER (Metal Core)"},"content":{"rendered":"<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"864\" height=\"378\" src=\"https:\/\/jdworld.netbird.cloud\/jdwos\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/jdwos-stream-player.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-316\" srcset=\"https:\/\/jdworld.netbird.cloud\/jdwos\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/jdwos-stream-player.png 864w, https:\/\/jdworld.netbird.cloud\/jdwos\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/jdwos-stream-player-300x131.png 300w, https:\/\/jdworld.netbird.cloud\/jdwos\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/jdwos-stream-player-768x336.png 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 864px) 100vw, 864px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>JDWorld OS Metal Core<\/strong> \u00e8 uno <strong>Stream-Player<\/strong> modulare che grazie all&#8217;uso di <code>yt-dlp<\/code> e <code>ffmpeg<\/code>, estrapola ed avvia al volo la traccia audio dai video Musicali di Youtube senza scaricare nulla sul pc ove \u00e8 in esecuzione.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">\ud83d\udce6 Scheda Tecnica del Pacchetto<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Name<\/strong>: JDWorld OS METALCORE STREAM PLAYER (<strong><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-luminous-vivid-amber-color\">jdwos-stream-player.jdw<\/mark><\/strong>)<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Architecture<\/strong>: Nativa Indipendente (x86_64)<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Distro<\/strong>: Arch Linux<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>License(s)<\/strong>: Simplified BSD Li